 "sentences": [
  "Same-article pairs (sa), 20,000 DEV pairs (dry run): the mean AUC of 1 dry seed of the OR-group rule (ratio reading) is 0.846 and the mean AUC of the 5 seeds of the study's stock model on the same pairs is 0.737; the difference is +0.109 [+0.102, +0.115] (paired article bootstrap, 95%), so R1-sa (above the stock model) is met. Minus word overlap (Jaccard, AUC 0.819): +0.027 [+0.021, +0.032], so R2-sa (above word overlap) is met.",
  "Next-paragraph pairs (np), 20,000 DEV pairs (dry run): the mean AUC of 1 dry seed of the OR-group rule (ratio reading) is 0.879 and the mean AUC of the 5 seeds of the study's stock model on the same pairs is 0.749; the difference is +0.130 [+0.123, +0.137] (paired article bootstrap, 95%), so R1-np (above the stock model) is met. Minus word overlap (Jaccard, AUC 0.864): +0.015 [+0.010, +0.019], so R2-np (above word overlap) is met.",
  "Next-paragraph pairs with every shared word removed (ns_all), 20,000 DEV pairs (dry run): the mean AUC of 1 dry seed of the OR-group rule (ratio reading) is 0.732 and the mean AUC of the 5 seeds of the study's stock model on the same pairs is 0.622; the difference is +0.110 [+0.100, +0.120] (paired article bootstrap, 95%), so R1-ns_all (above the stock model) is met.",
  "The ratio reading was defined on the DEV pairs after the tied rows of E4 were seen; the bar G2 of E4 was met in it only, not in the unit reading (the vote sum) that E4 named.",
  "Readings with no rule, sa (dev), ratio reading: minus word overlap (Jaccard), AUC 0.819: +0.027 [+0.021, +0.032], above; minus tf-idf cosine, AUC 0.824: +0.022 [+0.016, +0.027], above; minus PPMI cosine, AUC 0.854: -0.008 [-0.015, -0.002], below; minus the logistic regression on both paragraphs and their shared words (the baseline that was best on DEV in the study), AUC 0.871: -0.026 [-0.032, -0.019], below. The unit reading: mean AUC 0.825; minus the stock model +0.089 [+0.082, +0.095], above; minus word overlap +0.006 [+0.000, +0.012], above.",
  "Readings with no rule, np (dev), ratio reading: minus word overlap (Jaccard), AUC 0.864: +0.015 [+0.010, +0.019], above; minus tf-idf cosine, AUC 0.869: +0.010 [+0.005, +0.015], above; minus PPMI cosine, AUC 0.889: -0.010 [-0.016, -0.005], below; minus the logistic regression on both paragraphs and their shared words (the baseline that was best on DEV in the study), AUC 0.907: -0.029 [-0.034, -0.023], below. The unit reading: mean AUC 0.857; minus the stock model +0.108 [+0.101, +0.114], above; minus word overlap -0.008 [-0.012, -0.002], below.",
  "Readings with no rule, ns_all (dev), ratio reading: minus PPMI cosine (the baseline that was best on DEV in the study), AUC 0.808: -0.076 [-0.085, -0.068], below. The unit reading: mean AUC 0.702; minus the stock model +0.080 [+0.070, +0.090], above."
 ],
